          "en": "to provide a better response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.04,
          "end": 47.31,
          "en": "You learned that you should try to write your prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.31,
          "end": 50.73,
          "en": "by combining short, focused sentences",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.73,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "that contain any relevant information and keywords",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 55.86,
          "en": "that might be required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.86,
          "end": 59.67,
          "en": "but should avoid unnecessary information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.67,
          "end": 63.33,
          "en": "You might wanna consider defining your target audience,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.33,
          "end": 66.99,
          "en": "the tone, style, and length of the target output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.99,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "depending on what your prompt is all about, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 72.21000000000001,
          "en": "And that you can...",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.21000000000001,
          "end": 75.36,
          "en": "For example, all the control the output format.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.36,
          "end": 78.96000000000001,
          "en": "And for example, get ChatGPT to give you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.96000000000001,
          "end": 83.88,
          "en": "JSON formatted data instead of playing text as a response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.88,
          "end": 86.31,
          "en": "You then learned about the different tricks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.31,
          "end": 89.03999999999999,
          "en": "and prompting techniques you should be aware of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.03999999999999,
          "end": 92.07,
          "en": "like zero-, one-, or a few-shot prompting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.07,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "which in the end simply means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 97.74000000000001,
          "en": "that you could add extra examples or templates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.74000000000001,
          "end": 101.313,
          "en": "that should be used by ChatGPT to your prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.18,
          "end": 104.78999999999999,
          "en": "You learned about Ask-Before-Answer prompting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.78999999999999,
          "end": 108.96000000000001,
          "en": "which can be very useful since it gets ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.96000000000001,
          "end": 113.03999999999999,
          "en": "to tell you which extra information might be needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.03999999999999,
          "end": 116.13,
          "en": "And you learned about these more niche",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.13,
          "end": 118.59,
          "en": "and slightly more advanced techniques",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.59,
          "end": 123.06,
          "en": "like perspective prompting where for certain problems,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 126.33,
          "en": "it can be useful to get ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.33,
          "end": 128.58,
          "en": "to not just assume a single role",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.58,
          "end": 131.61,
          "en": "but multiple perspectives that can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.61,
          "end": 134.22,
          "en": "in the answer it generates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 137.31,
          "en": "And you learned that ChatGPT can help you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.31,
          "end": 138.75,
          "en": "write better prompts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.75,
          "end": 140.19,
          "en": "not just by telling you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.19,
          "end": 142.62,
          "en": "which extra information could be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.62,
          "end": 147.62,
          "en": "but also by getting ChatGPT to evaluate itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.96,
          "end": 151.02,
          "en": "or to give you example prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.02,
          "end": 155.37,
          "en": "or to even give you a list of prompting techniques",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.37,
          "end": 156.99,
          "en": "you could use in addition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.99,
          "end": 160.56,
          "en": "to the techniques you learned about in this section here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.56,
          "end": 164.31,
          "en": "Now, what's really important to keep in mind is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.31,
          "end": 169.31,
          "en": "ChatGPT still only gives you a starting point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 174.32,
          "en": "The output you get from ChatGPT can contain errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.51,
          "end": 177.87,
          "en": "and it can also be written in a very generic way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 177.87,
          "end": 181.44,
          "en": "So you should therefore always evaluate the output,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.44,
          "end": 185.82,
          "en": "improve it and add your own personal touch to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.82,
          "end": 189.42,
          "en": "Just throwing some problem at ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.42,
          "end": 193.23,
          "en": "and then using the output without testing or checking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.23,
          "end": 196.35,
          "en": "or improving it can sometimes work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.35,
          "end": 200.64,
          "en": "but can also sometimes lead to pretty bad results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 200.64,
          "end": 203.64,
          "en": "and potentially big problems.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.64,
          "end": 204.473,
          "en": "But with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204.473,
          "end": 207.42000000000002,
          "en": "we now get the prompt engineering out of the way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.42000000000002,
          "end": 210.78,
          "en": "and you now know what it takes to write good prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.78,
          "end": 214.38,
          "en": "And we're therefore ready to dive deeper into this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 214.38,
          "end": 217.65,
          "en": "and into ChatGPT and how it can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 217.65,
